{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T06:37:58+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-23T06:37:58+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Interroll Holding AG","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Specialty Industrial Machinery","country":"Switzerland","city":"Sant'Antonino","website":"https://www.interroll.com","employees":2602,"summary":"Interroll Holding AG provides material-handling solutions in Europe, the Middle East, Africa, the Americas, and the Asia Pacific. It offers rollers and wheels, roller drives, drum motors, controls, power supplies, carton flow products, and supermarket-cassettes, as well as light conveyor platform and autonomous mobile robot top modules. The company also provides sorter, modular conveyor platform (MCP), MCP PLAY, high performance conveyor platform, MCP cleanline, modular pallet platform, pallet flow-storage, and belt curve solutions. It serves various industries, including airport, courier, express and parcel, e-commerce, retail and fashion, food and beverage, manufacturing logistics, storage and distribution, and tire and automotive. Interroll Holding AG was founded in 1959 and is headquartered in Sant'Antonino, Switzerland.","exchange":"Swiss","currency":"CHF","financial_currency":"CHF","summary_fr":"Interroll Holding AG fournit des solutions de manutention en Europe, au Moyen-Orient, en Afrique, en Amérique et en Asie-Pacifique. Il propose des rouleaux et des roues, des entraînements à rouleaux, des tambours moteurs, des commandes, des alimentations électriques, des produits à flux de carton et des caisses de supermarché, ainsi qu'une plate-forme de transport de lumière et des modules mobiles autonomes. La société fournit également des solutions de tri, de plate-forme de convoyage modulaire (MCP), de plate-forme de convoyage haute performance, de ligne propre MCP, de plate-forme de palette modulaire, de stockage de flux de palettes et de cour